Package: elan-fingerprint-04f3-0c4b-local
Version: 1.0.0+local1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libfprint-2-tod1, fprintd
Maintainer: Local Administrator <root@localhost>
Description: Local ELAN 04f3:0c4b TOD fingerprint driver
 Provides the proprietary ELAN TOD driver required for USB fingerprint
 reader 04f3:0c4b together with an isolated private libcrypto.so.1.1.
 .
 The legacy OpenSSL library is kept under /opt and is used only through
 the driver's private RUNPATH. PAM configuration is not modified.
